//! The complete fitting pipeline (`glycoflow/fitting/pipeline.py::fit_site`).
//!
//! 1. propose: observation-guided GlycoFlow generation (method B) -> distinct refined basins;
//! 2. polish: longer, smaller-step refinement of the best few basins;
//! 3. support: which subtrees the observation supports;
//! 4. complete: unsupported subtrees regenerated by GlycoFlow conditioned on the supported part
//!    (prior-driven alternatives, flagged as such);
//! 5. alternatives: distinct basins within `alt_margin` objective units of the best
//!    (density-ambiguous alternatives; objective differences, not calibrated probabilities).

